# test: a shared enum constructor with an unknown named argument is an error
# Spec 07 Arguments: fn.arg.unknown-name, for a shared enum constructor
# call, which follows ordinary argument ordering (data.shared.arguments).
enum Status(code: i32, phrase: string):
    Ok -> Status(200, "ok")
    Bad -> Status(code=400, phrase="bad", extra=1) # diagnostic: unknown-named-argument
